    "narrative": "For today\u2019s slate, our offensive engine is centered on the matchup against Merrill Kelly. **Kyle Tucker** (79.51) and **Andy Pages** (74.83) are our strongest plays, benefiting immensely from an elite 19% boost due to the favorable SP_xERA of 5.13. **Kyle Tucker** remains our most reliable anchor despite a neutral platoon, while **Andy Pages** leverages his premium spot in the two-hole to maximize run-scoring potential. **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (73.10) also emerges as a high-value start; his 14% dynamic platoon edge against Tyler Mahle makes him a sneaky candidate for multi-hit production in what projects to be a high-scoring affair.\n\nThe decision to lean into speed and situational efficiency kept **Wade Meckler** (59.77) and **Jacob Wilson** (59.70) just inside the starting threshold, while **Luis Lara** (47.01) represents the most notable bench decision. **Luis Lara** was the final cut; while his switch-hitting versatility is an asset, the optimizer prioritized the higher ceiling of **Wade Meckler** in the leadoff spot against a suspect starter like Phillips. We are avoiding **Coby Mayo** (36.16) entirely today; facing a top-tier arm in Nathan Eovaldi\u2014who holds an elite 42% SB prevention rate\u2014rendered **Coby Mayo** a \"below floor\" option, preserving our games-played allocation for more favorable conditions.\n\nManagement must remain vigilant regarding the top of the order. While **Gunnar Henderson** (64.29) is a mandatory start, his 15% skill penalty against Eovaldi and the threat of Eovaldi\u2019s elite hold on baserunners dampen his overall projected efficiency. We are comfortable with our C1/C2 tandem of **Liam Hicks** (41.15) and **Drake Baldwin** (58.80) to provide modest production, though both are heavily tethered to their respective lineup placements. As **Jordan Westburg** remains on the IL, our current configuration maximizes our available talent pool against this specific rotation, specifically targeting the defensive vulnerabilities presented by the Arizona and Cincinnati staffs.",
